title: End
when: AmountOfPlayerTurns() > 0
when: AmountOfCurrentActorTurns() > 0
when: IsCurrentActor("Munir")
---
<<wait 2.5>>
<<SetShot "Closeup_B">>
Munir: It's been very nice to talk to you, Prince.
<<SetShot "Closeup_A">>
Prince: Thank you, it means a lot to me.
<<EndConversation>>
<<CompleteActivity>>
