title: End
when: AmountOfPlayerTurns() == 0
when: AmountOfCurrentActorTurns() > 0
when: IsCurrentActor("Munir")
---
<<wait 2.5>>
<<SetShot "Closeup_B">>
Munir: I feel like I've done most of the talking today.
Munir: Still... you listened. That matters more than people think.
<<SetShot "Closeup_A">>
Prince: I wanted to understand you better.
<<SetShot "Closeup_B">>
Munir: Then next time, bring me something from your side too.
<<SetShot "Closeup_A">>
Prince: I will.
<<EndConversation>>
<<CompleteActivity>>
===

title: End
when: AmountOfPlayerTurns() > 0
when: AmountOfCurrentActorTurns() == 0
when: IsCurrentActor("Munir")
---
<<wait 2.5>>
<<SetShot "Closeup_B">>
Munir: You came with a lot on your mind, Prince.
Munir: I didn't say much, but I was listening.
<<SetShot "Closeup_A">>
Prince: I hope I didn't speak too much.
<<SetShot "Closeup_B">>
Munir: No. Sometimes a man needs room to lay his thoughts out.
Munir: Just remember, conversation is a door, not a speech.
<<SetShot "Closeup_A">>
Prince: I'll remember that.
<<EndConversation>>
<<CompleteActivity>>
===

title: End
when: AmountOfPlayerTurns() == 0
when: AmountOfCurrentActorTurns() == 0
when: IsCurrentActor("Munir")
---
<<wait 2.5>>
<<SetShot "Closeup_B">>
Munir: Quiet day, huh?
<<SetShot "Closeup_A">>
Prince: Yeah. I guess neither of us really knew where to start.
<<SetShot "Closeup_B">>
Munir: That's alright. Not every silence is empty.
Munir: But if you want trust to grow, you have to bring something into the room.
<<SetShot "Closeup_A">>
Prince: Next time, I won't come empty-handed.
<<EndConversation>>
<<CompleteActivity>>
